⁻¹)`-line keeps a nonzero weight under convention D. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.ConventionDLines.zD_line_ratio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.ConventionDLines.zD_line_ratio","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ConventionDLineWeights.lean#L55-L61","doc":"**Convention D weighs the lines `[3]_q : 1`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.ConventionDLines.trace_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.ConventionDLines.trace_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ConventionDLineWeights.lean#L49-L53","doc":"Trace of the `(−q⁻¹)`-line projector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.ConventionDLines.trace_Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.ConventionDLines.trace_Pp","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ConventionDLineWeights.lean#L43-L47","doc":"Trace of the `q`-line projector. ","signatureChunk":0}]}